        "title": "Replace Freebuff streak Freebucks bonus with XP rewards",
        "summary": "The Freebuff CLI and shared common package replace the retired Freebucks daily bonus with an XP-based reward system. In common/src/util/freebuff-streak-line.ts, the getFreebuffStreakBonusNote function now returns a static message stating that streak days earn XP, removing dependencies on freebucksDailyBonus and GLM session logic. New files common/src/constants/freebuff-xp.ts and common/src/util/freebuff-xp-streak.ts define XP earning rules, including dailyStreakXp which calculates escalating daily XP and xpAtTier which scales rewards for limited-access accounts. The ThemeReferralAccess interface in common/src/types/theme-referral.ts gains optional subscribed and xp fields to support theme unlocking via subscriptions or XP accumulation.",
        "significance": "notable",
        "audience": "end-users",
        "evidence": "New files common/src/constants/freebuff-xp.ts and common/src/util/freebuff-xp-streak.ts define XP constants and streak calculation logic; common/src/util/freebuff-streak-line.ts removes the getFreebuffStreakPerk function and simplifies getFreebuffStreakBonusNote to a static XP message. common/src/types/theme-referral.ts adds optional subscribed and xp fields to ThemeReferralAccess.",
